  "releaseNotes": "Add ordered bootstrap method execution\n\n      - Introduce a new `[Bootstrap]` method attribute with optional execution order, and add a `LuciferBootstrap` startup component that discovers static parameterless bootstrap methods, sorts them by order, and runs them during framework initialization.\n      - `Lucifer` now forces `LuciferBootstrap` static constructor execution so bootstrap routines run automatically at startup, with fallback invocation and error logging for failed calls.",
